<title>SWITZERLAND: TABLE - Swiss producer/import prices rise in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Swiss producer/import prices rise in June.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices rose 0.1 percent in June to stand 0.4 percent higher than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				    June 1997   May 1997   June 1996</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change	+0.1	   +0.4	-0.2</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change	  +0.4	   +0.1	-2.5</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	  97.6	   97.5	97.2</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.  </p>
<p>The office also detailed the producer price index:</p>
<p>				    June 1997   May 1997   June 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change	+0.1	 +0.2	  +0.1</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change	  -0.6	 -0.7	  -1.9</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	  97.1	 96.9	  97.7</p>
<p>Import price index:</p>
<p>				    June 1997   May 1997   June 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change	-0.1	 +0.8	   -0.8</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change	  +2.7	 +2.0	   -4.1</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	  98.7	 98.9	   96.1</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
